{"id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-solovay-theorem.md","title":"Solovay's Theorem","display":"df-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-solovay-theorem","aliases":["89-df-solovay-theorem"],"display":"df-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-solovay-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-solovay-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of arithmetical realizations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 是下述定义的 PA 算术完备性性质缩写，模态逻辑、实现集合与 PA 可证句子集均取上述固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\,\n(\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\,\n(\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子只命名“PA 的可证明性逻辑恰为 GL”这一性质；Solovay 定理是\n该性质成立的证明，而不是定义的一部分。</li>\n<li>若目标理论换成一般递归可公理化算术理论，还必须明确其强度、所选\n可证明性谓词及适当的可靠性条件，不能从 PA 的版本无条件外推。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\,\n(\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})$ is the property defined in\n[[89-df-solovay-theorem]], and $\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})$ is PA\nconsistency."},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-theorem]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md